g overhead with your awesome bat wings!<br /> <br /> 7: Terrorize campers via the Blair Witch Project.<br /> <br /> 8: Sleep with the fishes without drowning in the process.<br /> <br /> 9: Avoid paying taxes!<br /> <br /> 10: Find out if bears crap in the woods.<br /> <br /> 11: Become a nudist.<br /> <br /> 12: Sing very loudly off key without feeling self conscious, you're alone in the wilds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 07-24-2014, 06:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-25T00:28:26-07:00","id":207974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hastur00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/206964-fun-activities-as-a-vampire?p=207295#post207295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pff. Frank Furter pulled this off in one night, in addition to choreographing a floor show, holding a dinner party, hosting a Transylvanian convention, and <i>creating life from inanimate tissu-</i>.<br /> <br /> Oh God...<br /> <br /> ...oh, GOD.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dr Furter was the best Nosferatu I've ever seen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link